 (original token count: 2923)\\nTotal output lines: 187\\n\\nd8a44759e6d69fc177bd2fc1c723af13ca2e0dd5\\n111476665 fix(dotfiles): preserve submodules during envelope detection\\n5fc8875dd fix(dotfiles): keep blob reader open until git exits\\nc7dfba213 fix(dotfiles): address encrypted sync review findings\\n8cefe6ce9 feat(dotfiles): encrypt shared files and support hardware identities\\n4febbceee feat(dotfiles): encrypted machine backups\\nd7a800310 docs(bootstrap): render whole-setup sync behavior\\naba68ab67 fix(bootstrap): notify once by default when setup sharing pauses\\n1dcefb64f fix(dotfiles): the automatic-sync replan stops the way the others do\\n6f5e38669 docs(bootstrap): one path from installing mise to a second machine\\n1698795d7 fix(bootstrap): --from-git follows the default branch, previews without a trace, and stops on a held configuration\\n8a7b5605f feat(dotfiles): a description command names the checkpoints the watcher saves\\nfdd8e3902 test(dotfiles): wait for the replan after the automatic configuration apply\\nea211419c fix(dotfiles): an explicit operation waits a bounded while for a running one\\n4d75f1581 docs(dotfiles): render the watch, sync, and pull help\\na191d9658 feat(bootstrap): --from-git sets a machine up from a setup repository, locally and over the remote bundle\\n395d13f7f feat(dotfiles): the watcher publishes, fetches, and applies shared changes on its own\\nf026570e1 fix(bootstrap): preflight incoming declarations and sources as a complete setup\\n66a2da1f5 fix(dotfiles): pause the complete setup on sync conflicts\\n41536d5f2 test(dotfiles): a manual-save file with unsaved edits holds the incoming version; a variant stream reaches its machine\\n9d289afec fix(dotfiles): a vanished branch is an error, only this machine's streams apply, and a kept deletion is published\\n .github/workflows/test-impl.yml                 |   13 +\\n CONTRIBUTING.md                                 |    2 +-\\n Cargo.lock                               