 Compiling async-backtrace v0.2.7\\n   Compiling age v0.12.1\\n   Compiling taplo v0.14.0\\n   Compiling chacha20poly1305 v0.11.0\\n   Compiling confique v0.4.0\\n   Compiling phf v0.14.0\\n   Compiling tabled v0.21.0\\n   Compiling calm_io v0.1.1\\n   Compiling comfy-table v8.0.0\\n   Compiling color-eyre v0.6.5\\n   Compiling usage-cli v6.8.0\\n   Compiling tera v1.20.1\\n   Compiling nodejs-semver v5.0.0\\n   Compiling jdx-tar v1.1.1\\n   Compiling contracts v0.6.10\\n   Compiling serde_ignored v0.1.14\\n   Compiling minisign-verify v0.2.5\\n   Compiling junction v2.0.0\\n   Compiling dotenvy v0.15.7\\n   Compiling netrc-rs v0.1.2\\n   Compiling shell-escape v0.1.5\\n   Compiling indoc v2.0.7\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a078ac-bf7f-7050-adcc-4d223220149d","create_time":1788732474.426976}}}
