{"timestamp":"2026-09-06T22:10:30.304Z","ordinal":9506,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9de4c5029887d0af94734993d113a2","status":"completed","call_id":"call_aWKcgsYlzqhD3hRWKAIhFpbe","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-takeover/TAKEOVER.md\\n@@\\n # Dotfiles stack takeover\\n+\\n+## Latest update: encryption added to checks (September 6)\\n+\\n+User explicitly included the finished encryption PR. The seven-PR scope now includes #12895, branch bootstrap/11-encrypted-backups, expected remote head11147666527317c2cfcb389f261a64922548976c. Its original full dispatched CI34059651602 passed and no unresolved threads were present. Existing heartbeat settle-dotfiles-pr-stack updated to include encryption (no duplicate automation). Preserve implementation, no plaintext fallback, no merges.\\n+\\n+Core final session57064 PASSED: render, lint-fix, sync_permissions, sync_preflight, rollback_review, bootstrap_from_git. All six local branches clean at the heads below; still NOT PUSHED. Encryption isolated worktree /Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-encryption/mise, branch codex/dotfiles-encryption-checks, rebased all five commits after old base d7a800310874a115ea813a851ea7c9b9d344206c onto auto4281da00d. Rebase COMPLETE, head0d658e3a7 plus uncommitted integration fixes. Other agent worktreef730 untouched. Build session81612 running.\\n+\\n+Encryption integration fixes: preserve Result-returning read_status and lock/update_status APIs, combine doctor backup health with failure-streak health, retain backup dedup regression tests in upload_tests module (encryption tests stay tests), accept encrypt in strict incoming declaration whitelist, keep normal uploads non-forced (scheme/policy changes use encryption's dedicated replace transaction), adapt fixtures to CoverageEntry.encrypt and new upload arguments. Encryption E2Es updated to opt into experimental tracking while env-age gate assertion explicitly disables experimental. Need compile, focused units/E2Es incl encrypted and core permission/preflight, render/lint, commit, then exact-lease push all seven and dispatch CI each head. Generated mise.usage.kdl chose ours during conflicts and MUST render. No replies/resolutions this heartbeat yet; four addressed core review IDs below still need replies after push.\\n \\n ## IN PROGRESS heartbeat September 6 21:43 UTC: main rebase and three new fixes\\n*** End Patch\"));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a078ac-bf7f-7050-adcc-4d223220149d","create_time":1788732610.501609}}}
