odex; model: openai/unavailable; version: unavailable.*\\n\\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\\n---\\n\\n> [!NOTE]\\n> **Medium Risk**\\n> Changes default unattended `origin set` behavior when `--sync` is omitted (now prompts or requires explicit flags) and alters what data leaves the machine via new `--private` and richer previews—important for privacy but scoped to experimental dotfiles history/sync.\\n> \\n> **Overview**\\n> This PR makes **where tracked files go** and **how aggressively origin sync runs** easier to see and control at connect time.\\n> \\n> **`mise bootstrap dotfiles track --private`** turns off both sharing and remote backups (local history unchanged). Retracking keeps **`encrypt = true`** and forces variant **`share`** off so inherited “share” variants cannot override privacy.\\n> \\n> **`origin set`** no longer defaults `--sync` on the CLI: interactive runs prompt whether to auto-publish and apply incoming changes; **`--sync`** picks `sync` / `manual` / `fetch-only` directly; **`--yes`** skips the mode question and uses the configured default (still `sync`). The connection preview lists captured paths under **Local only**, **Shared setup**, and **Remote backup** with plaintext vs encryption notes, and clarifies that share and backup are independent.\\n> \\n> **Tracking UX/docs:** experimental warnings on history/tracking docs; deprecation of `mise dotfiles` moved to a compatibility section; watcher health logs when running; **`--no-autosave`** gets an explicit manual-save info line instead of generic capture advice. macOS CI runs new **`test_dotfiles_onboarding`** E2E for private vs shared vs backup-only paths and manual sync behavior.\\n> \\n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 1e901234b6ab920dd11bc0279eebf414b679cb05. Bugbot is set up for automated code reviews on this repo. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\\n\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\\n\\n- **New Features**\\n  - Added `--private` to dotfiles tracking, keeping file contents local while preserving local protection.\\n  - Added clearer sync mode selection for connecting dotfiles origins, including interactive prompts and non-interactive behavior.\\n  - Connection disclosures now show whether files are local-only, shared, remotely backed up, or protected.\\n\\n- **Documentation**\\n  - Expanded guidance for sync modes, privacy controls, backups, and experimental dotfiles features.\\n  - Clarified command compatibility and what information leaves the device.\\n\\n- **Bug Fixes**\\n  - Watcher health status now reports when monitoring is active.\\n\\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:09:23Z\",\"files\":[{\"path\":\".github/workflows/test-impl.yml\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/cli/bootstrap/dotfiles/origin/set.md\",\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":2,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/cli/bootstrap/dotfiles/track.md\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/dotfiles.md\",\"additions\":14,\"deletions\":4,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/history.md\",\"additions\":30,\"deletions\":4,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"e2e/cli/test_dotfiles_onboarding\",\"additions\":46,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"mise.usage.kdl\",\"additions\":7,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"src/cli/dotfiles/capture_health.rs\",\"additions\":3,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"src/cli/dotfiles/origin.rs\",\"additions\":23,\"deletions\":4,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"src/cli/dotfiles/track.rs\",\"additions\":22,\"deletions\":4,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"src/system/history/sync/origin.rs\",\"additions\":45,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"}],\"headRefOid\":\"1e901234b6ab920dd11bc0279eebf414b679cb05\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:11:50Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/jdx/mise/actions/runs/34063300309/job/101567580778\",\"name\":\"title\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:11:47Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"conventional-commits\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:12:01Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/jdx/mise/actions/runs/34063310796/job/101567606477\",\"name\":\"title\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:11:58Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"conventional-commits\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:14:06Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/jdx/mise/actions/runs/34063410658/job/101567881265\",\"name\":\"title\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:14:04Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"conventional-commits\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:11:53Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/jdx/mise/actions/runs/34063301826/job/101567584353\",\"name\":\"complete\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:11:50Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"perf-pr-preflight\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:12:07Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/jdx/mise/actions/runs/34063301780/job/101567584078\",\"name\":\"zizmor\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:11:49Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"zizmor\"},{\"__typename\":\"StatusContext\",\"context\":\"CodeRabbit\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:12:01Z\",\"state\":\"PENDING\",\"targetUrl\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:15:51Z\",\"conclusion\":\"NEUTRAL\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://cursor.com/docs/bugbot\",\"name\":\"Cursor Bugbot\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:11:47Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:15:28Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://greptile.com/\",\"name\":\"Greptile Review\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:11:48Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:11:47Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://socket.dev/dashboard/org/jdx/sbom/6c31e881-3f4f-413e-9283-83a6703a87cf\",\"name\":\"Socket Security: Project Report\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:11:45Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:11:52Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://socket.dev\",\"name\":\"Socket Security: Pull Request Alerts\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:11:48Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"\"}]}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":534685875},"formatted_output":"{\"baseRefOid\":\"11147666527317c2cfcb389f261a64922548976c\",\"body\":\"Connecting dotfile history should make it clear which files leave the machine and whether incoming edits will be written automatically. Interactive `origin set` now asks that separately from connection confirmation, while `--sync` selects a mode directly and `--yes` accepts the configured mode for existing automation.\\n\\nThe connection preview lists actual captured paths under local-only, shared-setup, and remote-backup destinations with encryption status. `track --private` disables both sharing and backups, including explicit variant sharing overrides; retracking preserves encryption. Watcher/manual-save guidance and the experimental tracking documentation are clarified.\\n\\nStacked on #12895 (`bootstrap/11-encrypted-backups`). File declarations can still be shared, and changing a policy does not erase previous uploads.\\n\\nValidation: new onboarding/privacy E2E and existing tracking E2E passed; build, generated CLI documentation, and scoped safe hk checks passed. The existing sync E2E is being rerun after preserving its expected unattended-refusal wording.\\n\\n*AI-assisted — Tool: Codex; model: openai/unavailable; version: unavailable.*\\n\\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\\n---\\n\\n> [!NOTE]\\n> **Medium Risk**\\n> Changes default unattended `origin set` behavior when `--sync` is omitted (now prompts or requires explicit flags) and alters what data leaves the machine via new `--private` and richer previews—important for privacy but scoped to experimental dotfiles history/sync.\\n> \\n> **Overview**\\n> This PR makes **where tracked files go** and **how aggressively origin sync runs** easier to see and control at connect time.\\n> \\n> **`mise bootstrap dotfiles track --private`** turns off both sharing and remote backups (local history unchanged). Retracking keeps **`encrypt = true`** and forces variant **`share`** off so inherited “share” variants cannot override privacy.\\n> \\n> **`origin set`** no longer defaults `--sync` on the CLI: interactive runs prompt whether to auto-publish and apply incoming changes; **`--sync`** picks `sync` / `manual` / `fetch-only` directly; **`--yes`** skips the mode question and uses the configured default (still `sync`). The connection preview lists captured paths under **Local only**, **Shared setup**, and **Remote backup** with plaintext vs encryption notes, and clarifies that share and backup are independent.\\n> \\n> **Tracking UX/docs:** experimental warnings on history/tracking docs; deprecation of `mise dotfiles` moved to a compatibility section; watcher health logs when running; **`--no-autosave`** gets an explicit manual-save info line instead of generic capture advice. macOS CI runs new **`test_dotfiles_onboarding`** E2E for private vs shared vs backup-only paths and manual sync behavior.\\n> \\n> <sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 1e901234b6ab920dd11bc0279eebf414b679cb05. Bugbot is set up for automated code reviews on this repo. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\\n\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\\n\\n- **New Features**\\n  - Added `--private` to dotfiles tracking, keeping file contents local while preserving local protection.\\n  - Added clearer sync mode selection for connecting dotfiles origins, including interactive prompts and non-interactive behavior.\\n  - Connection disclosures now show whether files are local-only, shared, remotely backed up, or protected.\\n\\n- **Documentation**\\n  - Expanded guidance for sync modes, privacy controls, backups, and experimental dotfiles features.\\n  - Clarified command compatibility and what information leaves the device.\\n\\n- **Bug Fixes**\\n  - Watcher health status now reports when monitoring is active.\\n\\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-09-06T22:09:23Z\",\"files\":[{\"path\":\".github/workflows/test-impl.yml\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/cli/bootstrap/dotfiles/origin/set.md\",\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":2,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/cli/bootstrap/dotfiles/track.md\",\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/dotfiles.md\",\"additions\":14,\"deletions\":4,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"docs/history.md\",\"additions\":30,\"deletions\":4,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"e2e/cli/test_dotfiles_onboarding\",\"additions\":46,\"deletions\":0,\"changeType\":\"ADDED\"},{\"path\":\"mise.usage.kdl\",\"additions\":7,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"src/cli/dotfiles/capture_health.rs\",\"additions\":3,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"src/cli/dotfiles/origin.rs\",\"additions\":23,\"deletions\":4,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"src/cli/dotfiles/track.rs\",\"additions\":22,\"deletions